  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Network Map",
    "overview": "A career drawn as a metro network: jobs are lines, results are stations, skills carried between jobs are interchanges. The map leads; the page below keeps the same grammar with strip maps, branch lines, a station index and a signage terminus.",
